 a e.</l><l xml:id="m-cb03364a-e508-4acc-b6c3-64074c697849" facs="#m-0c1843b9-ad95-4e72-9f46-8e8e1aa777ae" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-45d2951b-fcfd-40ed-874d-a70e641ed1da" facs="#m-2d6fd70a-8fb7-4b9c-ae25-bca13b873f94" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-b9f65008-e78e-466d-b8d3-9492fe085995" facs="#m-5be206a3-38bd-4217-902d-c6e3bfe77bbe" label="lyrics-like">yCce nunc tempus acceptábile, lnon vituperétur ministérium no¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe3e84cf-8415-4597-be37-a2d472f61d4e" facs="#m-fc208094-8785-4ef0-9bc8-b3c0989bbcea" label="lyrics-like">Ca ecce nunc dies salútis : t némi-l strum.</l><l xml:id="m-a0735a99-8f62-40dd-a114-545241fc9925" facs="#m-ff6d8fe6-2c21-4943-9dfd-53ba64c65efe" label="lyrics-like">ni dantes ullam offensiónem, *ut</l><l xml:id="m-352dd2d9-40f2-4d88-8c4f-6e13bfa24237" facs="#m-b052a8bd-3016-40b3-9fdf-8d4edb279790" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scápulis suis. V. Scúto. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-b6c7f208-976e-4cc6-9847-ce3d446d8d1a" facs="#m-002c7fb9-1a2d-4f6f-9ed8-e7ea15dab7fa" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-2daece74-d1bd-42f3-960a-52f156947f2a" facs="#m-a8f372b8-4ef2-4b9e-8028-0dc5a6662b4c" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-bdae62fb-adf9-4c2c-97bc-cdbf258db1ae" facs="#m-702f48dc-e597-4c80-8b16-b1cf3ee828d4" label="ambiguous">s.°</l><l xml:id="m-3543c2ca-1b7d-4703-be5e-720e787d129f" facs="#m-7fa679aa-b1e2-4013-870f-bd800a50ee2c" label="lyrics-like">DOminum“Dé-um tú-um adorá-bis, et slli só-li</l><l xml:id="m-4fd95ded-e0f5-481d-b727-9586f89ba46c" facs="#m-7a990a57-21c1-40a0-8103-98644b1cfac8" label="lyrics-like">sérvi- es. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-bfdd2b54-2732-4519-a567-9e39c1948dd8" facs="#m-4ca61345-c4f9-4132-9d20-21149f27774d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-2b3f68e6-3551-4012-ab29-32d05d6672b2" facs="#m-33e5263b-8ab7-45ce-966c-8d029f9a33ff" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-a03d52c6-9b97-4df8-a495-a247e3be1f76" facs="#m-da9dc0ed-0cec-4561-82d0-fa56757085cc" label="lyrics-like">T castigáti, et non mortificáti : !l autem locupletántes: "tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-88ba1fab-586a-4ce8-8725-4793e12e8ef1" facs="#m-addb6e2d-073a-4916-a842-44e23d4f3c8e" label="lyrics-like">U quasi tristes, semper autem nihil habéntes, et ómnia possidén¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cd6069d-11e9-4897-9779-c023b1f342e7" facs="#m-217cbef1-7372-4bef-9e88-5f28b04a83a3" label="lyrics-like">gaudéntes: sicut egéntes, multos! tes.</l><l xml:id="m-ed2e6442-369a-4c0d-a757-cd4338e0628f" facs="#m-df9087d7-cc66-4c90-acde-e23097463739" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scúto. V. Angelis súis. p. 248.</l><l xml:id="m-36c097b2-3615-447d-b32b-b51d5ed61d26" facs="#m-6b37601c-d99b-40bd-8fd6-f12655e712cb" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-815ebc1a-8fa5-402a-914f-3152479e385e" facs="#m-4b8b596c-3c28-489e-947b-1bc90af7dce9" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-a9eb7624-ec03-4138-ba1e-ff00a39fb084" facs="#m-16130bb3-baf1-45e4-adb2-27e06580e9df" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-cf6c1620-a8e8-4067-94fe-2ea22494ce0c" facs="#m-86e8a48b-4fa6-4692-9854-5b283399ebc6" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-e51abbc8-362c-4622-bd99-ac5fd431d5b2" facs="#m-37e0ca38-c67b-43de-8dbd-a3e78b5ca6c7" label="lyrics-like">NRatres: Hortámur vos, ne in vá¬Ait enim: Témpore accépto exau¬</l><l xml:id="m-828b61a0-97a7-4acc-b301-f1d0b8bdd8d8" facs="#m-f1fbbf9b-9a82-49a1-b1d1-c29cf4cda6db" label="lyrics-like">cuum grátiam Dei recipiátis. tl divi te,* et in die salútis adjúvi te.</l></lg>
